{"speciesId":438,"names":{"fr":"Manzaï","es":"Bonsly","en":"Bonsly","ja":"ウソハチ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It looks as if it is always crying. It is actually adjusting its body’s fluid levels by eliminating excess."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its eyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Adepte des climats secs, il régule son humidité en laissant couler ce qui ressemble à des larmes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Adepte des climats secs, il régule son humidité en laissant couler ce qui ressemble à des larmes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il préfère les sols arides. Il évacue l’eau par ses yeux pour réguler ses fluides corporels."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para ajustar los niveles de fluido corporal."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its eyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"乾燥した 場所を 好む。 目から 水を 出して 体の 水分を 調節する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Adepte des climats secs, il régule son humidité en laissant couler ce qui ressemble à des larmes."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para ajustar sus niveles de hidratación corporal."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"乾燥した 空気を 好む。 水分を 調節 するときに 出す 水が 涙に 見える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il préfère les sols arides. Il évacue l’eau par ses yeux pour réguler ses fluides corporels."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para ajustar los niveles de fluido corporal."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its eyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"乾燥した 場所を 好む。 目から 水を 出して 体の 水分を 調節する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Adepte des climats secs, il régule son humidité en laissant couler ce qui ressemble à des larmes."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para ajustar sus niveles de hidratación corporal."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"乾燥した 空気を 好む。 水分を 調節 するときに 出す 水が 涙に 見える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Comme il a horreur de l’eau, on le trouve surtout dans les régions arides. Avec si peu de verdure alentour, on le repère tout de suite."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"No le gusta el agua, por lo que suele vivir en lugares secos. Como hay poco verdor a su alrededor, suele destacar mucho."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It does not deal well with water, so it lives in dry locales. Since its surroundings tend to lack greenery, it stands out noticeably."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"水が 苦手で 乾いた 場所に 棲んでいる。 周りに 緑が 少ないので よく 目立つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il se débarrasse des liquides superflus par ses yeux. La composition chimique de ces liquides ressemble à celle de la sueur humaine."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Expulsa por los ojos el líquido corporal que le sobra. La composición química de este líquido se parece a la del sudor de los seres humanos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"From its eyes, it can expel excess moisture from its body. This liquid is similar in composition to human sweat."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"身体の 余計な 水分を 目から 外に 出す。 その 成分は 人間の 汗に 似ている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il évacue tout surplus d’eau par les yeux. Cela ressemble à une crise de larmes et a parfois pour effet d’attendrir ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Expulsa agua por los ojos, lo que da la impresión de que está llorando. Esto puede sorprender a los enemigos y hacer que bajen la guardia."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It discharges moisture from its eyes, making it look like it’s crying—apparently an effective way of getting enemies to let down their guard."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"瞳から 水分を 放出。 泣いているように 見えるので 敵を 油断させる 効果も あるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Absorber trop d’humidité peut mettre sa vie en danger, c’est pourquoi il « sue » tout excès de liquide par les yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Debido a que un exceso de humedad en su cuerpo puede provocarle la muerte, expulsa líquido por los ojos como si fuera sudor."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"If its body gets too damp, it will die. So, in a process reminiscent of sweating, its eyes expel moisture."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"あまり 身体が 湿りすぎると 死んでしまうので 汗の ように 目から 水分を 出している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il évacue sa sueur et ses larmes par les yeux. Sa sueur a un goût légèrement salé, tandis que ses larmes ont un soupçon d’amertume."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Expulsa sudor y lágrimas por los ojos. El sudor es ligeramente salado y las lágrimas tienen un leve regusto amargo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It expels both sweat and tears from its eyes. The sweat is a little salty, while the tears have a slight bitterness."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"汗と 涙を 目から 流す。 汗は ちょっぴり しょっぱくて 涙は ほんのり 苦い 味だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il vit dans les zones rocheuses arides. Quand ses boules vertes sont sèches, elles se mettent à briller légèrement."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Vive en entornos áridos y pedregosos. Cuanto más se secan sus esferas verdes, más destaca su sutil lustre."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon lives in dry, rocky areas. As its green spheres dry out, their dull luster increases."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"乾燥した 岩場に 暮らす。 緑の 玉は 乾くほど ツヤツヤと 鈍く 輝く。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its tears elicit sympathy from those who see them, but do not be deceived! This expulsion of body water is merely a physiological mechanism for keeping itself in good health."}],"varieties":[{"id":438,"moves":[{"name":"slam","learns":[[8,"level-up",38],[9,"level-up",38],[10,"level-up",38],[11,"level-up",38],[14,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"nam